    </div>

    <div class="faq-list reveal" data-delay="100">
      <article class="faq-item open">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>Is the ₦20,000 plan unlimited?</span><i></i></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. The advertised WetomNet offer provides unlimited monthly internet access for eligible service locations, subject to the applicable service terms and coverage assessment.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Which technology will be installed at my location?</span><i></i></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>WetomTech will assess your location and recommend fibre/FTTH, radio or satellite based on available infrastructure, line of sight, service requirements and site conditions.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Does the monthly fee include installation?</span><i></i></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>The ₦20,000 amount is the monthly internet subscription. Installation, equipment or special deployment charges may apply and will be confirmed after the coverage assessment.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>How is payment completed?</span><i></i></button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>After submitting your details, the website creates an OPay Cashier session and redirects you to OPay's secure hosted checkout page to complete payment.</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
